/* 组件默认样式隔离（isolated）——与 elder-checkin-modal/material-usage-modal
   的 feedback-sheet-* 骨架同一套交互手法，但配色改为宣纸米黄 + 印章红，
   不复用赤金色系，视觉上与"业务表单类"弹窗区分开 */

.vmd-backdrop {
  position: fixed !important;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  z-index: 999998 !important;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
}

.vmd-backdrop.show {
  opacity: 1;
}

.vmd-panel {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 999999 !important;
  width: 100%;
  /* 🎨（2026-09-07 今日善行日签 UI 重构）宣纸温润底色：与
     utils/posterGenerator.ts 的 drawMeritTagPoster 背景渐变改用同一组色值
     （#FDFBF7 → #FAF7F2），弹窗与最终导出的海报视觉调性保持完全统一 */
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FDFBF7 0%, #FAF7F2 100%);
  border-top-left-radius: 32rpx;
  border-top-right-radius: 32rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 28rpx calc(28rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) !important;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  transform: translateY(100%);
  transition: transform 0.25s ease;
}

.vmd-backdrop.show .vmd-panel {
  transform: translateY(0);
}

/* 🎨（2026-09-07）典雅内边框：呼应海报 drawEleganceBookBorder 的双线边栏
   质感，用同一个暗金描边色（#B8965A）在面板内侧勾一圈细边，纯装饰、不吃
   点击事件，也不设背景色，不会挡住下方任何按钮/文字 */
.vmd-panel::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 10rpx;
  left: 14rpx;
  right: 14rpx;
  bottom: 10rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(184, 150, 90, 0.4);
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.vmd-drag-handle {
  width: 72rpx;
  height: 8rpx;
  border-radius: 4rpx;
  background: #E3D9C8;
  margin: 0 auto 24rpx;
}

.vmd-header {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8rpx;
  margin-bottom: 28rpx;
  text-align: center;
}

.vmd-title {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: bold;
  /* 🎨（2026-09-07）与海报正文墨色 #3D2B1B 对齐，此前 #5A4632 是弹窗独有的
     一份相近但不完全一致的墨色，两处统一成同一个色值 */
  color: #3D2B1B;
}

.vmd-subtitle {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  /* 🎨（2026-09-07）与海报辅助文字色 #8A6D4C 对齐，理由同上 */
  color: #8A6D4C;
}

.vmd-tag-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16rpx;
  margin-bottom: 32rpx;
}

.vmd-tag-chip {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  padding: 22rpx 20rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 2rpx solid #E8DFC8;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.vmd-tag-chip.active {
  border-color: #BD3124;
  background: #FDF1EE;
}

/* 🐛 点击瞬间的按压反馈：与 wxml 的 hover-class="vmd-tag-chip-hover" 配套，
   让用户在 setData 重渲染完成前就能立刻确认"这一下点击被识别到了" */
.vmd-tag-chip-hover {
  opacity: 0.7;
  transform: scale(0.97);
}

.vmd-tag-emoji {
  font-size: 36rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.vmd-tag-label {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #5A4632;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.vmd-tag-check {
  position: absolute;
  top: 10rpx;
  right: 14rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #BD3124;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.vmd-submitted-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  margin-bottom: 32rpx;
}

.vmd-submitted-chip {
  padding: 12rpx 24rpx;
  background: #FDF1EE;
  border: 2rpx solid #BD3124;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  color: #BD3124;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.vmd-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.vmd-btn-skip {
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 88rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  color: #A08A6A;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #E8DFC8;
  border-radius: 44rpx;
}

.vmd-btn-skip::after {
  border: none;
}

.vmd-btn-submit {
  flex: 2;
  min-height: 88rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  /* 🎨（2026-09-07）渐变终止色改用 #7A1508——与
     utils/drawVolunteerCertificate.ts 的 drawSealStamp inkTexture 渐变圆心色
     完全一致，让"按钮的红"与"印章的红"是同一份仿朱砂印泥色系，不是各自
     选一个"看起来差不多的红" */
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #BD3124 0%, #7A1508 100%);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: bold;
  border-radius: 44rpx;
  border: none;
  box-shadow: 0 6rpx 16rpx rgba(189, 49, 36, 0.30);
}

.vmd-btn-submit::after {
  border: none;
}

.vmd-btn-submit:active {
  opacity: 0.85;
}

.vmd-btn-submit.btn-is-disabled {
  opacity: 0.5;
  box-shadow: none;
}
